/Title (One of the strongest aspects of Gemini's response was its focus on the possible consequences of different copyright policies. For example, it considered whether giving full copyright protection to AI generated content could result in large numbers of automatically generated works competing with human creators. This shows an important aspect of critical thinking because it considers not only the immediate issue but also what could happen as a result of a particular decision.)
