/Title (Gemini also proposed a middle ground by separating purely AI generated works from works that contain significant human creative contributions. However, its response was longer and somewhat repetitive in places. Some statements about copyright law and legal decisions were also presented without specific sources, so those claims would need to be checked before being treated as established facts.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 525 0 R
/Next 594 0 R
>>
