/Title (Gemini also makes a detailed attempt to rebut the arguments in favour of AI copyright. Rather than simply repeating that AI lacks human authorship, it challenges the analogies between AI prompting and activities such as directing a film or framing a photograph.)
/Dest [20 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 595 0 R
/Next 526 0 R
